<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f5f0e8;
        font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      }
      .wrapper {
        background-color: #f5f0e8;
        padding: 40px 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #fdfaf5;
        border: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 74, 0.15);
        border-radius: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-top: 2px solid #b89140;
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 40px 40px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 74, 0.2);
      }
      .logo {
        font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
        font-weight: 300;
        color: #b89140;
        font-size: 22px;
        letter-spacing: 0.25em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-decoration: none;
        display: block;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 35px 40px;
      }
      h1 {
        font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
        color: #000000;
        font-size: 26px;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 0 25px;
        font-weight: 300;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }
      p {
        color: #000000;
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-size: 15px;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }
      .text-muted {
        color: #6b5f4e;
      }
      .payment-card {
        background: #f5f0e8;
        border: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 74, 0.2);
        border-radius: 0;
        padding: 25px;
        margin: 25px 0;
      }
      .payment-card .amount {
        font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 28px;
        color: #b89140;
        font-weight: 400;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 0 20px;
      }
      .payment-detail {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 10px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 74, 0.1);
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .payment-detail:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }
      .payment-label {
        color: #a97c50;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .payment-value {
        color: #000000;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      table.details {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 0;
      }
      table.details td {
        padding: 10px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 74, 0.1);
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      table.details tr:last-child td {
        border-bottom: none;
      }
      .label {
        color: #a97c50;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .value {
        color: #000000;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: right;
      }
      .btn-cta {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #b89140;
        color: #fdfaf5;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 0;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 14px;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }
      .btn-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 30px 0 10px;
      }
      .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background-color: rgba(201, 161, 74, 0.2);
        margin: 30px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 25px 40px;
      }
      .footer p {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #a97c50;
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .footer .brand {
        font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #b89140;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
          <a href="https://pavillonleslys.com" class="logo">PAVILLON LES LYS</a>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
          <h1>Paiement confirmé</h1>

          <p>Bonjour {{firstName}} {{lastName}},</p>

          <p>Nous confirmons la bonne réception de votre paiement. Voici le
            récapitulatif :</p>

          <div class="payment-card">
            <div class="amount">{{payment.amount}} FCFA</div>
            <table class="details">
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Type</td>
                <td class="value">{{payment.type}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Date</td>
                <td class="value">{{payment.date}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Référence</td>
                <td class="value">{{payment.reference}}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="label">Méthode</td>
                <td class="value">{{payment.method}}</td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </div>

          <p class="text-muted">Vous pouvez consulter l'ensemble de vos
            paiements depuis votre espace personnel.</p>

          <div class="btn-wrapper">
            <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn-cta">Voir mes paiements</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="footer">
          <p class="brand">Pavillon Les Lys — Excellence & Convivialité</p>
          <p>Riviera Palmeraie, Abidjan — Côte d'Ivoire</p>
          <p><em>Ce message est automatique, merci de ne pas y répondre
              directement.</em></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>